{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a product catalog API behind ESA and an API gateway, with RDS for data, OSS for images, and Tair for caching."}
{"t":"req","text":"Avoid Elasticsearch due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","ecs","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace shoppers","group":"internet","why":"Browsers and apps querying the catalog API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the marketplace domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets and accelerates API calls globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"api-gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes, throttles and authenticates catalog API requests."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"api-gw","why":"Blocks injection attacks and bots on the API."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-api-gw","from":"esa","to":"api-gw","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Catalog API servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the product catalog API across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-gw-app","from":"api-gw","to":"app","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"say","text":"Product data goes to RDS, hot queries hit Tair cache, and images are served from OSS via ESA."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Catalog cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches hot product lookups to reduce DB load."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Product catalog DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores product metadata with a zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product photos that ESA serves directly."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes API access logs and alerts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API with ESA, API Gateway plus WAF, ECS compute, Tair cache, RDS database and OSS image storage."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add Lindorm for full-text and fuzzy search over product titles, replacing Elasticsearch per your legal team's ban."}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"lindorm","label":"Product search index","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-search","from":"app","to":"search","label":"search"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added Lindorm as the search index for full-text and fuzzy product queries, avoiding Elasticsearch per policy."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Qwen via Model Studio and reading documents from OSS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Frankfurt","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","model-studio","oss","milvus","rds","tair","sls","acr","nat","eip"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Company staff asking the knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the assistant domain to the ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes employee HTTPS traffic into the cluster."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Kubernetes cluster hosting Dify workloads."}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify","group":"vpc","attachTo":"ack","why":"Self-hosted low-code agent and RAG builder."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"say","text":"Dify calls Qwen through Model Studio and reads company docs from OSS for RAG."}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"frankfurt","why":"Serves Qwen models for the assistant."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-model","from":"ack","to":"model-studio","label":"API"}
{"t":"node","id":"oss","product":"oss","label":"Company docs","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores internal documents for RAG ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-oss","from":"ack","to":"oss","label":"read"}
{"t":"node","id":"milvus","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus vector store","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Holds document embeddings for retrieval."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-milvus","from":"ack","to":"milvus","label":"vectors"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Dify metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Persists Dify workflows, users and configs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and frequent lookups."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding egress, container registry and logging to complete the setup."}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Outbound internet for pulling images and APIs."}
{"t":"node","id":"eip","product":"eip","label":"EIP","group":"vpc","attachTo":"nat","why":"Public IP for NAT outbound traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-nat","from":"ack","to":"nat","label":"egress"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores custom Dify container images."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-acr","from":"ack","to":"acr","label":"pull","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"frankfurt","why":"Collects Dify application and audit logs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Self-hosted Dify on ACK in Frankfurt with Model Studio for Qwen, OSS for documents, Milvus for vectors, RDS and Tair."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB, WAF, ECS compute, RDS database and OSS document storage."}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data stays in Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","nat","eip"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"Insurance customers submitting claims and documents."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the portal domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates portal access and caches static assets for policyholders."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes portal traffic across two availability zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the claims portal from web attacks and bots."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the claims portal application in two zones for HA."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales portal servers during peak claim submission periods."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Now adding the database, document storage and outbound networking, all within Tokyo."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores claim records and policyholder data with zone standby."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Claim documents","group":"tokyo","why":"Stores uploaded claim documents and evidence files in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"upload"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Provides outbound internet for server patches without public IPs."}
{"t":"node","id":"eip","product":"eip","label":"EIP","group":"vpc","attachTo":"nat","why":"Public IP for NAT Gateway outbound access."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-nat","from":"app","to":"nat","label":"SNAT"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"Centralized audit logs for compliance and monitoring in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS Auto Scaling, RDS and OSS, all data staying in Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"Pinned rules require all policyholder data to stay in Tokyo, so I cannot replicate the database to Singapore."}
{"t":"say","text":"Instead, your analytics team can access reporting dashboards hosted in Tokyo over a private CEN link."}
{"t":"rec","product":"cen","fit":"primary","why":"Private network linking Singapore office to Tokyo VPC without moving data out of Japan."}
{"t":"rec","product":"quick-bi","fit":"complement","why":"BI dashboards running in Tokyo that Singapore analysts view over CEN."}
{"t":"done","summary":"Cannot replicate claims DB to Singapore due to Japan data residency; use CEN plus Quick BI in Tokyo instead."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Qwen chatbot to the portal. Model Studio runs in Tokyo, so all data stays in Japan."}
{"t":"plan","products":["model-studio","ai-gateway"]}
{"t":"node","id":"llm","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen via Model Studio","group":"tokyo","why":"Answers policyholder questions using Qwen models hosted in Tokyo."}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Routes and rate-limits LLM calls from the portal securely."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-ai-gw","from":"app","to":"ai-gw","label":"chat"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ai-gw-llm","from":"ai-gw","to":"llm","label":"LLM API"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AI Gateway in the VPC and Model Studio (Qwen) in Tokyo for the portal chatbot, all data stays in Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a private hybrid setup with Express Connect from your data center to a Jakarta VPC hosting MongoDB and RDS."}
{"t":"req","text":"Data stays in Jakarta region","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","privatezone","mongodb","rds"]}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"Your Data Center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"dc","product":"onprem-dc","label":"On-premises DC","group":"onprem","why":"Hosts the SaaS application servers."}
{"t":"group","id":"jakarta","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Private VPC","parent":"jakarta"}
{"t":"node","id":"ec-onprem","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect (DC)","group":"onprem","why":"Dedicated private line endpoint at your facility."}
{"t":"node","id":"ec-vpc","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect (VPC)","group":"vpc","why":"Virtual border router linking dedicated line into VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dc-ec-onprem","from":"dc","to":"ec-onprem","label":"private link","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-onprem-ec-vpc","from":"ec-onprem","to":"ec-vpc","label":"dedicated line","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns-pz","product":"privatezone","label":"PrivateZone","group":"vpc","why":"Resolves database endpoints privately without public DNS."}
{"t":"node","id":"mongodb","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores document data for the SaaS platform."}
{"t":"node","id":"rds","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational store for structured SaaS data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-vpc-mongodb","from":"ec-vpc","to":"mongodb","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ec-vpc-rds","from":"ec-vpc","to":"rds","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Private hybrid architecture: on-premises app servers reach Jakarta-hosted MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL over Express Connect with no internet exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a hardened live-streaming architecture. Per platform rules, Anti-DDoS Proxy must sit behind ESA, so traffic flows: users → ESA → Anti-DDoS Proxy → ALB → servers → cache."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","anti-ddos-proxy","alb","waf","ecs","tair","live","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers and streamers","group":"internet","why":"End users watching or broadcasting live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the streaming domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge defense","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets, accelerates dynamic API calls and provides first-layer DDoS defense."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubbing center that filters large L3-L7 volumetric attacks before they reach the origin."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-ddos","from":"esa","to":"ddos","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes scrubbed traffic across app servers in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks, CC floods and malicious bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ddos-alb","from":"ddos","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the streaming platform backend across two availability zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app","label":"HTTP"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores viewer sessions, tokens and hot metadata for low-latency reads."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache","label":"Redis"}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and distributes the actual live video streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-live","from":"app","to":"live","label":"control","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Media storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores recorded streams, thumbnails and static web assets."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"recordings"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes access logs and security events for alerting and forensics."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"logs"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming platform with ESA fronting Anti-DDoS Proxy, ALB with WAF, dual-zone ECS servers, Tair cache, ApsaraVideo Live and OSS."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind ALB, RDS for metadata, and OSS for images. No Function Compute used."}
{"t":"req","text":"No serverless functions allowed","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","tair","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App Users","group":"internet","why":"People uploading and browsing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates image delivery and caches static assets globally."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes API traffic across ECS instances in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Protects the API from injection and bot attacks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"API Servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing backend logic on virtual machines."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales ECS fleet during traffic spikes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Adding Tair for session caching, RDS for metadata, and OSS for storing uploaded images."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches user sessions and feed data for fast reads."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user profiles, photo metadata and comments."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Image Storage","group":"sg","why":"Durable object storage for all uploaded photos."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-images","from":"esa","to":"images","label":"serve"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logging and monitoring for the backend."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend with ECS behind ALB, WAF protection, Tair cache, RDS database, OSS image storage, and ESA edge acceleration."}

{"t":"say","text":"Since Function Compute is forbidden, I'll add an ECS worker fleet that polls OSS for new uploads and generates thumbnails."}
{"t":"node","id":"workers","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail Workers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Polls OSS for new photos and generates thumbnails without serverless functions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-workers-images","from":"workers","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added a two-zone ECS thumbnail worker fleet that reads new uploads from OSS and writes back generated thumbnails."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 이용자 데이터를 서울 리전에 저장하는 게임 서버 아키텍처를 구성하겠습니다."}
